  noUnseen:'No unseen words here.', noHard:'No difficult words yet.', noAudio:'Audio is not installed yet.', audioLoadFail:'Could not load the audio.',
  doc_privacy:'<h1 class="pg">Privacy policy</h1><p>Barik does not collect or share personal data. There is no sign-up, no advertising and no analytics.</p><h2>What is stored on your device</h2><p>Learning progress, settings and flagged words are stored only on your phone. They are deleted with the app or with the "Reset progress" button. If Google backup is turned on, Android may keep them in your personal backup so your progress survives a phone change.</p><h2>Purchases</h2><p>Subscription payments are processed by Google Play. To check the subscription status the app uses RevenueCat, which receives an anonymous install identifier and purchase details (product, date, term). The app never sees your name, email or payment details. Policies: Google — policies.google.com/privacy, RevenueCat — revenuecat.com/privacy.</p><h2>Permissions</h2><p>The app only needs internet access to buy and verify the subscription. Words, audio and fonts are built in and work offline.</p><h2>Children</h2><p>The app is not designed to collect data from children and does not collect it.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>The developer\'s address is listed on the app\'s Google Play page.</p>',
  doc_terms:'<h1 class="pg">Terms of use</h1><p>Level A1 and the alphabet are free. The Barik Premium subscription unlocks levels A2–C2.</p><h2>Subscription</h2><p>The subscription is monthly or yearly through Google Play and renews automatically until you cancel it. Cancel in Google Play: Payments & subscriptions → Subscriptions; access remains until the end of the paid period. If a free trial is offered, you are charged when it ends unless you cancel before. Refunds follow Google Play rules.</p><h2>Content</h2><p>The dictionary is made for learning Eastern Armenian in reformed spelling. We try to avoid mistakes; if you find one, flag the word with the "Mistake in this word?" button.</p>',
